wer-fields ["q-99392/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "53fca396-4ade-5180-9c9b-a73f24f5b5b8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99392"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450/selection/e07f854b66aac1b039c23eed4d18c7150f08c1eb875b0bc16906d3aa8f912bb0" :answer/id #uuid "42108951-81c9-56b3-8980-0c115e0adb27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,6t{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450/selection/55de01b1ce9e625da5a587ffd8b00629869d172cae916f7e3dbee5b778879580" :answer/id #uuid "1bcee2ac-675c-5f32-ab97-d9bf176c87c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450/selection/42b1b08aa11bd0a257a231071347753f87c6cd4692525c77189422fd1cadefd5" :answer/id #uuid "2e215379-4040-5a8f-800c-e5c6db1212b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450/selection/2d29744253c7a401c793c83a5252f4c3338ccaede32508e359e7c9f235ae8764" :answer/id #uuid "52ce1447-b0e5-5f2a-987c-362f6d0d46e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,3t{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450/selection/8f1cdc0ca3ed3581b64e806e63293f8f866d6bdccf629bbadf65fbb9a4490090" :answer/id #uuid "19717bac-4237-5d76-a720-c8dcbf7eda29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,2t{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c6fe81d9-832d-50de-b858-d79aa164d2fd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123450/selection/42b1b08aa11bd0a257a231071347753f87c6cd4692525c77189422fd1cadefd5" :answer-field/choices ["q-123450/selection/e07f854b66aac1b039c23eed4d18c7150f08c1eb875b0bc16906d3aa8f912bb0" "q-123450/selection/55de01b1ce9e625da5a587ffd8b00629869d172cae916f7e3dbee5b778879580" "q-123450/selection/42b1b08aa11bd0a257a231071347753f87c6cd4692525c77189422fd1cadefd5" "q-123450/selection/2d29744253c7a401c793c83a5252f4c3338ccaede32508e359e7c9f235ae8764" "q-123450/selection/8f1cdc0ca3ed3581b64e806e63293f8f866d6bdccf629bbadf65fbb9a4490090"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123450" :question/id #uuid "d4f8fc37-cca0-530f-8347-2eb6c354f4a3" :question/math-academy-id "q-123450" :question/problem "Find $\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,6t{e}^{({t}^{2}-1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,6t{e}^{({t}^{2}-1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 6t{e}^{({t}^{2}-1)}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=6t{e}^{({t}^{2}-1)},$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u={t}^{2}-1.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2t\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2t}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 6t{e}^{({t}^{2}-1)}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 6t{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2t}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\int {e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3{e}^{u}+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =3{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,6t{e}^{({t}^{2}-1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,3{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{{t}^{2}-1}⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123450/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "53fca396-4ade-5180-9c9b-a73f24f5b5b8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123450"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378/selection/db97a580b704b8218195bcb456a1bd6e7ae39bf1132c8e2b95b1136eca720d94" :answer/id #uuid "166a60e6-716c-551b-a7dd-3beb0c13fae9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378/selection/fca2f5b7ec809207757bc5ae4d59d2abba8189f2b3c9647ef1726d8a9c7d9632" :answer/id #uuid "728197e8-77cf-5e4a-a9a8-bb0d0d95bf18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,{e}^{2t}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378/selection/0498c8eea09a7ef1190515b1e9457edff480f8452b44394146f9b38f76b47951" :answer/id #uuid "0c45f96d-03b1-5bd6-bb3a-31d5d9f60d80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{({e}^{2t}+e)}{2}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378/selection/0f43ee74007fe11c11ae0e5825ff4e3bb7b6ed79f7bd02ddf22cf6a88e6c1188" :answer/id #uuid "b5b1a71d-f4b0-5165-94b6-4b0e922559d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378/selection/f3fd9d4e16a3660b231b5c37e51c12948b513f0f80b9676e5bf92860f1126f1c" :answer/id #uuid "bcefa098-1f2f-539a-970b-dabe8993220c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7b09ba27-ddf7-5f44-89a9-f9023f3c7f27" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-99378/selection/f3fd9d4e16a3660b231b5c37e51c12948b513f0f80b9676e5bf92860f1126f1c" :answer-field/choices ["q-99378/selection/db97a580b704b8218195bcb456a1bd6e7ae39bf1132c8e2b95b1136eca720d94" "q-99378/selection/fca2f5b7ec809207757bc5ae4d59d2abba8189f2b3c9647ef1726d8a9c7d9632" "q-99378/selection/0498c8eea09a7ef1190515b1e9457edff480f8452b44394146f9b38f76b47951" "q-99378/selection/0f43ee74007fe11c11ae0e5825ff4e3bb7b6ed79f7bd02ddf22cf6a88e6c1188" "q-99378/selection/f3fd9d4e16a3660b231b5c37e51c12948b513f0f80b9676e5bf92860f1126f1c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-99378" :question/id #uuid "bb6f108b-b2c6-57c1-9132-69c2656eace2" :question/math-academy-id "q-99378" :question/problem "Find $\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,2{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 2{e}^{(2t+1)}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=2{e}^{(2t+1)},$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=2t+1.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 2{e}^{(2t+1)}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 3{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\int {e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}{e}^{u}+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{(2t+1)}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\frac{3{e}^{(2t+1)}}{2}⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-99378/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "53fca396-4ade-5180-9c9b-a73f24f5b5b8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99378"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-50201"] :question/problem "Find $\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{t},\\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\text{d}t.$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{3}{t},\\,\\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{3}{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\frac{5}{{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+{c}_{1},\\,-\\frac{5}{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|,\\,-\\frac{5}{t}⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437/selection/86dca92d848f9d400082b0ccd12e934d9e4d5d02d9cceeff9711dc1697eed930" :answer/id #uuid "2ce5478b-9a72-55ff-b65d-51d747a90918" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437/selection/2e3288b3bff8560c3f586fa11ac9cb17199da1a1370513e6833af35b37005d47" :answer/id #uuid "101cbc3d-8ada-5787-9d21-feee751379e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437/selection/ee500c04e7532cc88b77977a64a5dc6d99aa5b0cc0b6593d7852ce34138eadb9" :answer/id #uuid "eb066872-e293-5a52-8a19-b26ef182a5a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437/selection/f312dfeb0570df37901f606eb569ea4e4ee06726b5baeb1369ec5d7b9e7fb2c4" :answer/id #uuid "c3220efa-582f-58e2-a10e-77732718dde1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{e}^{t-1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437/selection/f9cdad634031eb68c0061a4da28d19c644ff00ed0d827d9c4c3d725478e0de5a" :answer/id #uuid "97612383-f607-5ead-84a2-f7aff88224f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{e}^{5t},\\,5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t-\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a90f7e6-ebbb-53f5-b993-94997e7d0347" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123437/selection/2e3288b3bff8560c3f586fa11ac9cb17199da1a1370513e6833af35b37005d47" :answer-field/choices ["q-123437/selection/86dca92d848f9d400082b0ccd12e934d9e4d5d02d9cceeff9711dc1697eed930" "q-123437/selection/2e3288b3bff8560c3f586fa11ac9cb17199da1a1370513e6833af35b37005d47" "q-123437/selection/ee500c04e7532cc88b77977a64a5dc6d99aa5b0cc0b6593d7852ce34138eadb9" "q-123437/selection/f312dfeb0570df37901f606eb569ea4e4ee06726b5baeb1369ec5d7b9e7fb2c4" "q-123437/selection/f9cdad634031eb68c0061a4da28d19c644ff00ed0d827d9c4c3d725478e0de5a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123437" :question/id #uuid "0f7f0bed-7a5e-5c15-8327-bc7f4c63ab8a" :question/math-academy-id "q-123437" :question/problem "Find $\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\text{d}t=⟨\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)={e}^{t},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int {e}^{t}\\text{d}t={e}^{t}+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6}),$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 10\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{2}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =5(\\operatorname{sin}⁡u)+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{e}^{t}+{c}_{1},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t-\\frac{\\pi }{6})⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123437/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "53fca396-4ade-5180-9c9b-a73f24f5b5b8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123437"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-349120/field-1/5521c093c4d60c23d630a99bc791ac7318f4615e164361df756510ffc0408a97" :answer/id #uuid "a159bc41-3073-54fd-9d41-96df91fdf37d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{14}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349120/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "334a7142-6723-5ba2-88dc-746ad9e1b227" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349120/field-1/5521c093c4d60c23d630a99bc791ac7318f4615e164361df756510ffc0408a97" :answer-field/choices ["q-349120/field-1/5521c093c4d60c23d630a99bc791ac7318f4615e164361df756510ffc0408a97"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349120/field-2/5ddf1398a72794af7bbd78367253a2cb77708f5ae4c48a65e9682fe980544cdf" :answer/id #uuid "5527e6fb-25ea-5abb-bfe2-5caf5e77b00c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}(e^4-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-349120/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "07ffd7dc-bcac-5d3f-b3d1-b57dffec5ed2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-349120/field-2/5ddf1398a72794af7bbd78367253a2cb77708f5ae4c48a65e9682fe980544cdf" :answer-field/choices ["q-349120/field-2/5ddf1398a72794af7bbd78367253a2cb77708f5ae4c48a65e9682fe980544cdf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-349120" :question/id #uuid "e5a3b17e-dbd2-5a41-b6fd-4f7c093aad74" :question/math-academy-id "q-349120" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨4{t}^{2}-3t,\\,5{e}^{2t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨4{t}^{2}-3t,\\,5{e}^{2t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{0}^{2}(4{t}^{2}-3t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}5{e}^{2t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component,\n\n$$\n\\int (4{t}^{2}-3t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{4}{3}{t}^{3}-\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFor the second component,\n\n$$\n\\int 5{e}^{2t}\\,\\text{d}t=5\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2t}=\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{2t}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨4{t}^{2}-3t,\\,5{e}^{2t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(\\frac{4}{3}{t}^{3}-\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{2}){|}_{0}^{2},\\,(\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{2t}){|}_{0}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{4}{3}(8)-\\frac{3}{2}(4))-0,\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{32}{3}-6),\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{14}{3},\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{14}{3},\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-349120/field-1" "q-349120/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-349120"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455/selection/070363362b4ac8b45da117a6bfdf557a9732bd0db603e6ec78693169582beba8" :answer/id #uuid "ea3c7f4a-c072-5c21-b514-7491b0307349" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{2},\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455/selection/aa203e315db87a0d6604600320ca6231ae093767a2383bf0359a2f2d35c2eda2" :answer/id #uuid "d61b0d03-74f7-5115-aec6-5d0be34eb5da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455/selection/e362bb84d16d39f15c9953c61df73e3318fe84c179b9c6db17447d4e382b01f5" :answer/id #uuid "0b0d661a-8de7-5b4e-b8af-63ab8f467f76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455/selection/98e2c4b764c2b19737e742223a05233e2d5a389227cc2d289451569e1d9efd5d" :answer/id #uuid "5a8aeac5-0608-55fa-86ba-2fd15f406f07" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,2-\\sqrt{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455/selection/7f7a71a5069cef29a4a439c88b0538f62a8e9a334027994e6ee3d74136036ffa" :answer/id #uuid "a8fbc396-687c-5932-ae5e-517e58a209ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e6df3ca9-9779-51b2-b842-2959e2fbeaab" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123455/selection/7f7a71a5069cef29a4a439c88b0538f62a8e9a334027994e6ee3d74136036ffa" :answer-field/choices ["q-123455/selection/070363362b4ac8b45da117a6bfdf557a9732bd0db603e6ec78693169582beba8" "q-123455/selection/aa203e315db87a0d6604600320ca6231ae093767a2383bf0359a2f2d35c2eda2" "q-123455/selection/e362bb84d16d39f15c9953c61df73e3318fe84c179b9c6db17447d4e382b01f5" "q-123455/selection/98e2c4b764c2b19737e742223a05233e2d5a389227cc2d289451569e1d9efd5d" "q-123455/selection/7f7a71a5069cef29a4a439c88b0538f62a8e9a334027994e6ee3d74136036ffa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123455" :question/id #uuid "eb8b3222-c045-5fd0-b252-08063208b15e" :question/math-academy-id "q-123455" :question/problem "${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4},\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}))-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})),\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123455/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123455"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200/selection/e2eb0f8ccc2562dcc97e56d7e5d76807d87d31619b1cb2368d1be621791e8a76" :answer/id #uuid "15dca4c7-3011-5bf4-a411-9c51f5b2cd0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨25,\\,5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200/selection/15881598ef5e1d9316e722c7ef9312e801f82e2d22948dff9067827f861fbb06" :answer/id #uuid "71336adc-b8ab-570f-a41e-3a13bcbfe090" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨27,\\,\\frac{14}{3}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200/selection/1e396bc862a9bced86945bebbab4cda6f324893c49a24466bd182439e9ce081f" :answer/id #uuid "d22eff86-7b7b-5b44-aaa9-4d21282cef3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨22,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200/selection/5a24d62d512d0d29d6d63bf0dc5a3ae4a8c837100287af2e9e16071ce7bb3e70" :answer/id #uuid "4c8de7be-6249-5fad-adb6-7ad8d727d789" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨22,\\,\\frac{14}{3}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200/selection/d5bd7f846ce8b472fb0579e660bb0945f104ab4940d3e12c12d9994d5dd9c49a" :answer/id #uuid "72531e39-483e-508c-89cf-2761e1bdb608" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨27,\\,6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d018d7a9-e1d5-57f4-877e-e5a4c0f18fa7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-50200/selection/15881598ef5e1d9316e722c7ef9312e801f82e2d22948dff9067827f861fbb06" :answer-field/choices ["q-50200/selection/e2eb0f8ccc2562dcc97e56d7e5d76807d87d31619b1cb2368d1be621791e8a76" "q-50200/selection/15881598ef5e1d9316e722c7ef9312e801f82e2d22948dff9067827f861fbb06" "q-50200/selection/1e396bc862a9bced86945bebbab4cda6f324893c49a24466bd182439e9ce081f" "q-50200/selection/5a24d62d512d0d29d6d63bf0dc5a3ae4a8c837100287af2e9e16071ce7bb3e70" "q-50200/selection/d5bd7f846ce8b472fb0579e660bb0945f104ab4940d3e12c12d9994d5dd9c49a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-50200" :question/id #uuid "3fb6e671-f6b6-5a74-97b2-ded0b0f24246" :question/math-academy-id "q-50200" :question/problem "Evaluate ${\\int }_{1}^{4}⟨4t-1,\\sqrt{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}⟨4t-1,\\,\\sqrt{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{1}^{4}(4t-1)\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(2{t}^{2}-t){|}_{1}^{4},\\,(\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{{t}^{3}}){|}_{1}^{4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(2(4)^{2}-4)-(2(1)^{2}-1),\\,\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{{4}^{3}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{{1}^{3}}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨27,\\,\\frac{14}{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-50200/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-50200"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278/selection/3469fd067a415c05a0762d2c76e5e6a85ad1406c4a995ce69aad858564498d4b" :answer/id #uuid "f598b8db-3592-5a75-8d76-a54d42c72eb7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨12,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278/selection/211c46fc539d91f0c6ece555e202f4e272ae6624be7151dfefd29506e6bcc6e0" :answer/id #uuid "4fc97488-78fb-59c4-9546-6870aa183348" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨12,\\,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278/selection/08bc5aa330eb356094ced6324562bba6c4348056f24606225b1ab961546e7024" :answer/id #uuid "d5f56ea7-9631-5f59-9187-61d953c00639" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨8,\\,4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278/selection/c8315d38ea74bd5bc2a797b9e9334ce34c06f1d05a1432b86fae3b94fca76c56" :answer/id #uuid "15e38a9f-18a5-55eb-b75c-399f1a7de01c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨20,\\,8⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278/selection/b86085eb77530ae3b5dab2db5cca369c69f7a9d177c6f548fa13090029f81b06" :answer/id #uuid "9df959ad-243a-542d-8375-9dc3267642f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,\\,5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4cbe63d8-b753-571d-a3a2-d74d931dde12" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-99278/selection/211c46fc539d91f0c6ece555e202f4e272ae6624be7151dfefd29506e6bcc6e0" :answer-field/choices ["q-99278/selection/3469fd067a415c05a0762d2c76e5e6a85ad1406c4a995ce69aad858564498d4b" "q-99278/selection/211c46fc539d91f0c6ece555e202f4e272ae6624be7151dfefd29506e6bcc6e0" "q-99278/selection/08bc5aa330eb356094ced6324562bba6c4348056f24606225b1ab961546e7024" "q-99278/selection/c8315d38ea74bd5bc2a797b9e9334ce34c06f1d05a1432b86fae3b94fca76c56" "q-99278/selection/b86085eb77530ae3b5dab2db5cca369c69f7a9d177c6f548fa13090029f81b06"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-99278" :question/id #uuid "b6a4c9ec-988e-50b9-a11d-a4ebe9c71ccb" :question/math-academy-id "q-99278" :question/problem "${\\int }_{1}^{4}⟨2t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\text{d}t=$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}⟨2t-1,\\,\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{1}^{4}(2t-1)\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨({t}^{2}-t)\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{4},\\,\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{4}\\,\\,⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\text{ }({4}^{2}-4)-({1}^{2}-1),\\,\\sqrt{4}-\\sqrt{1}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨12,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-99278/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3081ffe7-c448-5e0d-8dd1-808d23199a7f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99278"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-99361"] :question/problem "${\\int }_{1}^{9}⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,1⟩\\text{d}t=$" :question/worked-solution "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{9}⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\,1⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{1}^{9}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{9}1\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\sqrt{t}\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{9},\\,t\\,\\,{|}_{1}^{9}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\sqrt{9}-\\sqrt{1},\\,9-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,8⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473/selection/6f8c19ee5d0b65199fa6ac723741e8a83631e2cbfdd4d0869eb3f72c85546c5d" :answer/id #uuid "b897f139-a4ba-5344-8a98-287f18f06309" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5{t}^{3}-5,\\,4{({t}^{2}-1)}^{2}+4⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473/selection/fae0b452ac09e977907d1cedec2280bdd232310f7383f5449538989c5af33b28" :answer/id #uuid "fa75420d-2c57-58b9-a218-e4b4de77f891" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5{t}^{5}-4,\\,4{(t-1)}^{2}+5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473/selection/a09582e86368ace3ba19bd76044305d76b2e623ef416ca44dc4c71e2a8b82626" :answer/id #uuid "130ced5e-2101-50d3-a5cf-0ba1213c922a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5{t}^{4}+4,\\,4{({t}^{2}-1)}^{2}+5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473/selection/faef2d4be4b0d8bdba3785197d21f3ff7ba88f181c8d266b374e266be33f9f50" :answer/id #uuid "2d6d4f96-cf20-5241-910f-416af48283de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{2}-4,\\,4{({t}^{4}-1)}^{2}-5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473/selection/760733e0b5adffd89dfad0ae171fe8534793eb722fc6f22307c6255947f44459" :answer/id #uuid "cbfb4e63-de6c-5a4b-9499-09e4228e5459" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨5{t}^{4}-4,\\,4{({t}^{2}-1)}^{2}+5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ecf022d1-f4cf-53df-be49-568ea2c868a4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123473/selection/760733e0b5adffd89dfad0ae171fe8534793eb722fc6f22307c6255947f44459" :answer-field/choices ["q-123473/selection/6f8c19ee5d0b65199fa6ac723741e8a83631e2cbfdd4d0869eb3f72c85546c5d" "q-123473/selection/fae0b452ac09e977907d1cedec2280bdd232310f7383f5449538989c5af33b28" "q-123473/selection/a09582e86368ace3ba19bd76044305d76b2e623ef416ca44dc4c71e2a8b82626" "q-123473/selection/faef2d4be4b0d8bdba3785197d21f3ff7ba88f181c8d266b374e266be33f9f50" "q-123473/selection/760733e0b5adffd89dfad0ae171fe8534793eb722fc6f22307c6255947f44459"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123473" :question/id #uuid "bbc5ca63-1df5-5c8f-890f-d266498c8163" :question/math-academy-id "q-123473" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨20{t}^{3},\\,16t({t}^{2}-1)⟩$ and $F(1)=⟨1,\\,5⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨20{t}^{3},\\,16t({t}^{2}-1)⟩\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨20{t}^{3},\\,16t({t}^{2}-1)⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 20{t}^{3}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 16t({t}^{2}-1)\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨5{t}^{4}+{c}_{1},\\,4{({t}^{2}-1)}^{2}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨1,\\,5⟩$ gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨5\\cdot {1}^{4}+{c}_{1},\\,4{({1}^{2}-1)}^{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,5⟩ \\\\ ⟨5+{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=-4$ and ${c}_{2}=5.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨5{t}^{4}-4,\\,4{({t}^{2}-1)}^{2}+5⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123473/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123473"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474/selection/b7bc92c7702e8669a3841923411b8d0ee9a80049a2acd48052edba42842665b9" :answer/id #uuid "34364ab1-eb6b-513e-b87a-98bf44363d25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4{t}^{1/3}+1,\\,{e}^{t}-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474/selection/514405fdeb4ab4b33c81123e17df70d7253aa59eff84d18cd707c6a1a85df1ae" :answer/id #uuid "7b77aede-9c55-5ec3-9e49-8d826f858596" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4{t}^{4/3}-2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474/selection/7eb17aef15abc5a01af5d4c5398a2dc72b1e190e9e695c862c78782322053b57" :answer/id #uuid "cac5345a-435b-5d99-86cd-ad99e17a19b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474/selection/dbe5f4085050f787425c57ec162794362ad70921d915a295e81424e01bfd45c8" :answer/id #uuid "f05d4e77-3f85-5d2a-b440-3d79f4567766" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{2t}-5⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474/selection/3bf8d943a62b7c05a9632bde9fdb9809128f4046ca629fff2c3b1b4198e3ae0c" :answer/id #uuid "4445b6b7-0280-50d9-ab9d-cc1c2e794140" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,5{e}^{5t}-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0d1f277b-a634-584c-8716-a16b3efc218b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123474/selection/7eb17aef15abc5a01af5d4c5398a2dc72b1e190e9e695c862c78782322053b57" :answer-field/choices ["q-123474/selection/b7bc92c7702e8669a3841923411b8d0ee9a80049a2acd48052edba42842665b9" "q-123474/selection/514405fdeb4ab4b33c81123e17df70d7253aa59eff84d18cd707c6a1a85df1ae" "q-123474/selection/7eb17aef15abc5a01af5d4c5398a2dc72b1e190e9e695c862c78782322053b57" "q-123474/selection/dbe5f4085050f787425c57ec162794362ad70921d915a295e81424e01bfd45c8" "q-123474/selection/3bf8d943a62b7c05a9632bde9fdb9809128f4046ca629fff2c3b1b4198e3ae0c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123474" :question/id #uuid "01a82786-6006-50b3-9639-081950d67e5b" :question/math-academy-id "q-123474" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩$ and $F(0)=⟨2,\\,-1⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3},\\,5{e}^{5t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{16\\sqrt[3]{t}}{3}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 5{e}^{5t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4{t}^{4/3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{5t}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(0)=⟨2,\\,-1⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(0)=⟨4\\cdot {0}^{4/3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{5\\cdot 0}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,-1⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨2,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=2$ and ${c}_{2}=-2.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨4{t}^{4/3}+2,\\,{e}^{5t}-2⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123474/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123474"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472/selection/d429624c16c53fcecfe79c17703bc25e7b55120b956e53945f9f8697c928d12c" :answer/id #uuid "90eaad86-4441-535a-a919-a0fa4bcd1ef7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨{sec}^{2}⁡t-3,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3t)-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472/selection/6977b215a969d91840b41e287af7c11fbf98489b29536373a35e5a5b5c354ce7" :answer/id #uuid "a3a5b411-336e-51fe-8ab3-55e2088c195f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t-2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t)+3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472/selection/10797fef79e345b013c815fc7c489b2ef930f61976709cfcfafca6d565f34389" :answer/id #uuid "b2d23ef0-0b7f-5141-be91-ee6cc6610eea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t-2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472/selection/da573bfe7aa169ca194d48ae74a695cf01144063c6f7317fab105b320751c2b8" :answer/id #uuid "ab95f828-5fd5-5c17-bf84-e9a6ce37bf3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡(2t)-2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+3⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472/selection/1adc5170706433f4fb68aedf612c4c4aae17b3018bf940f32de2ffb04651e7c2" :answer/id #uuid "b94ab33f-1a30-5aaf-817c-3eba7b1831d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+3,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "73928db4-1843-53d5-aae7-df1684f68398" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123472/selection/10797fef79e345b013c815fc7c489b2ef930f61976709cfcfafca6d565f34389" :answer-field/choices ["q-123472/selection/d429624c16c53fcecfe79c17703bc25e7b55120b956e53945f9f8697c928d12c" "q-123472/selection/6977b215a969d91840b41e287af7c11fbf98489b29536373a35e5a5b5c354ce7" "q-123472/selection/10797fef79e345b013c815fc7c489b2ef930f61976709cfcfafca6d565f34389" "q-123472/selection/da573bfe7aa169ca194d48ae74a695cf01144063c6f7317fab105b320751c2b8" "q-123472/selection/1adc5170706433f4fb68aedf612c4c4aae17b3018bf940f32de2ffb04651e7c2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123472" :question/id #uuid "ff7e196f-5947-5cda-8ba7-68642d1d79ef" :question/math-academy-id "q-123472" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\,,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)⟩$ and $F(\\pi )=⟨-3,\\,3⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\,,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\,,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(\\pi )=⟨-3,\\,3⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(\\pi )=⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\pi )+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨-3,\\,3⟩ \\\\ ⟨-1+{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨-3,\\,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=-2$ and ${c}_{2}=3.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t-2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+3⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123472/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123472"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470/selection/40d5dca09e320c81c798a80e7aff2857682ede65036a6af6ddd0e3bdc80d2f02" :answer/id #uuid "3914a990-f10b-5eab-a43b-a38059132bc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2})+1,\\,{t}^{2}-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470/selection/c447ee64de003b0905359f015630e3da2b01525a953adbb1380279c805357f3b" :answer/id #uuid "98db7085-865f-526b-ae26-8094e5080586" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2})-1,\\,{t}^{2}+1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470/selection/835343bf75e96d91ca0f4b20f73e2b29654a039ee9c650532311fa10a5912f82" :answer/id #uuid "0023e485-9f1d-5dd6-a4d8-9439dbc86f4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2})-2,\\,t+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470/selection/eed320e71285c64e71d2faca442de561c1e8abfb5885846d4dd52fd0c4046088" :answer/id #uuid "bc4fa49a-5431-5531-9294-268e54d3ef02" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2})+1,\\,{t}^{2}+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470/selection/74649fe9cc450ee20f35aa2ec8532281193b988b4c500cdff9c7c72c9e4a68b0" :answer/id #uuid "b7216938-c3eb-57b3-8f84-a17622cdf910" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+1,\\,{t}^{2}+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a4fc821-29c8-5a74-8daf-915001f4cadc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123470/selection/eed320e71285c64e71d2faca442de561c1e8abfb5885846d4dd52fd0c4046088" :answer-field/choices ["q-123470/selection/40d5dca09e320c81c798a80e7aff2857682ede65036a6af6ddd0e3bdc80d2f02" "q-123470/selection/c447ee64de003b0905359f015630e3da2b01525a953adbb1380279c805357f3b" "q-123470/selection/835343bf75e96d91ca0f4b20f73e2b29654a039ee9c650532311fa10a5912f82" "q-123470/selection/eed320e71285c64e71d2faca442de561c1e8abfb5885846d4dd52fd0c4046088" "q-123470/selection/74649fe9cc450ee20f35aa2ec8532281193b988b4c500cdff9c7c72c9e4a68b0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123470" :question/id #uuid "0f39c4f8-ac41-5b15-bc05-f02a4b75d093" :question/math-academy-id "q-123470" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\frac{2}{t},\\,2t⟩$ and $F(1)=⟨1,\\,3⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\frac{2}{t},\\,2t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{2}{t},\\,2t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{2}{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int 2t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|t|+{c}_{1},\\,{t}^{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2})+{c}_{1},\\,{t}^{2}+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(1)=⟨1,\\,3⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(1)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({1}^{2})+{c}_{1},\\,(1)^{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,3⟩ \\\\ ⟨{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=1$ and ${c}_{2}=2.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡({t}^{2})+1,\\,{t}^{2}+2⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123470/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123470"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742/selection/4e618f3a467b8871b7ddd85f2d9c400d72b2c8073fb0f0de973c395cf1cd1b15" :answer/id #uuid "115bf5a7-c670-5b2a-a951-dde4b6ae211e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)+1,\\,2\\operatorname{sec}⁡(t)-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742/selection/6c3a4ad285b825b13fc9fbf1bfd49df1aff07f35af040b3b9bfdfea4c8b64d3f" :answer/id #uuid "adbc70a9-661f-5ae3-8a95-309ed7e0fa25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+\\frac{1}{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(t)⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742/selection/6d2c0980c8114c289aec0acd9ef0de234d2bf3b7da373d5d1108146e2c478014" :answer/id #uuid "d50cc422-cf84-53e7-af5e-1765870899df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)-\\frac{1}{2},\\,2\\operatorname{sec}⁡(t)+2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742/selection/53dd2a21ed8cbc53de0e03fcc8bf805a87f27605a207484bf1c57dcaea039093" :answer/id #uuid "26d7e3f5-c99a-55d7-92c7-e3edf3e59c64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+\\frac{1}{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(t)-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742/selection/433135eedafe4b93cb0b4002165703422b928aa0dc360df5bbb68b06f1a72c22" :answer/id #uuid "3496da0e-a912-529f-ac1c-bf604cdb59bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)-1,\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(t)-1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c308601e-b0bf-5bb8-a2ae-a94cd63e565b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-85742/selection/53dd2a21ed8cbc53de0e03fcc8bf805a87f27605a207484bf1c57dcaea039093" :answer-field/choices ["q-85742/selection/4e618f3a467b8871b7ddd85f2d9c400d72b2c8073fb0f0de973c395cf1cd1b15" "q-85742/selection/6c3a4ad285b825b13fc9fbf1bfd49df1aff07f35af040b3b9bfdfea4c8b64d3f" "q-85742/selection/6d2c0980c8114c289aec0acd9ef0de234d2bf3b7da373d5d1108146e2c478014" "q-85742/selection/53dd2a21ed8cbc53de0e03fcc8bf805a87f27605a207484bf1c57dcaea039093" "q-85742/selection/433135eedafe4b93cb0b4002165703422b928aa0dc360df5bbb68b06f1a72c22"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-85742" :question/id #uuid "e8cce85e-bb38-5a8a-b3de-95c194a0eee1" :question/math-academy-id "q-85742" :question/problem "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\,,{sec}^{2}⁡(t)⟩$ and $F(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=⟨1,\\,0⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\,,{sec}^{2}⁡(t)⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\,,{sec}^{2}⁡(t)⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int {sec}^{2}⁡(t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(t)+{c}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe initial condition $F(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=⟨1,\\,0⟩$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,0⟩ \\\\ ⟨\\frac{1}{2}+{c}_{1},\\,1+{c}_{2}⟩ & =⟨1,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${c}_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}$ and ${c}_{2}=-1.$ Consequently\n\n$$\nF(t)=⟨\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+\\frac{1}{2},\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡(t)-1⟩.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-85742/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8dd18a5b-d7a1-5590-ae70-f47ff5b464b1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-85742"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
